      "type": "assistant/chunk",
      "data": "{\"partId\":\"prt_04726ce88001eAztpUPona2WLl\",\"text\":\"Lighthouses stand as timeless beacons along rugged coastlines, guiding mariners safely through perilous waters. Emerging from dense fog or pitch-black nights, their sweeping light beams offer reassurance and direction to sailors navigating treacherous rocky shores. Historically crafted from stone or iron, these towering structures withstand relentless ocean waves and fierce coastal winds. Within their lantern rooms, powerful Fresnel lenses focus bright light miles across the dark sea, warning ships of hidden shoals and shallow reefs. Beyond their practical maritime function, lighthouses symbolize hope, vigilance, and sanctuary, enduring as iconic monuments to human ingenuity and perseverance amidst nature's unpredictable, untamed elements.\"}",
